   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kommunf&#xF6;rbundet Blekinge in cooperation with local authorities i Kaliningrad/ANKR.   Increase capacity among staff and professionals within care for disabled in various rayons, develop working methods to increase possibilities for integration of disabled.</narrative>
